  "contentHtml": "<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/6e143325-c7c7-37f3-3355-975fc53161bb.png\" width=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span>Hey Brew Shop Fam!<br>Here's an update of what's happening this week - from new&nbsp;beer drops, wine reviews, our current tap list, to upcoming tastings, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/bv34EWPGuzg?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP THIS WEEK’S NEWSLETTER HERE</a>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/ySH_MoegsdJ?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP OUR ENTIRE STOCK OF BEER, WINE &amp; HOMEBREW HERE</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/02fa4d31-c761-3d5e-1d21-9e6259fa71dc.jpeg\" width=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>Join us this</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Friday from 5-7 PM</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> as we welcome Chris from&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>The Robins Cellars&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>for our free tasting! Check back next week for our August line-up!</span></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/a5a9df9e-80b7-85bd-16ac-1b9ae2bc1002.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>👋 Welcome to San Diego’s <strong>Eppig Brewing</strong>!<br>• <strong>1866 Lager</strong><br>• <strong>Helles</strong><br>• <strong>Wake Up &amp; Slay</strong> West Coast IPA with Citra, Simcoe &amp; Mosaic</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/521d9eed-38dd-a6fd-7340-377efa67ffae.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>🍨 <strong>Drekker </strong>Delights<br>• <strong>Fluff Stuff Mango Guava</strong> Sour<br>• <strong>Prrrt These Days Gummy Sour</strong><br>• <strong>Chonk Rainbow Sherbert</strong> Sundae Sour<br>• <strong>Animals in the Deep End</strong> IPA with Citra, Simcoe Cryo, Alora &amp; Dolcita Abstrax (collab with <strong>FInback</strong>!)<br>• <strong>Shredneck</strong> DIPA with Simcoe Cryo, Peacharine &amp; Peacharine Hop Kief</p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/381dfde2-369a-0586-5bdc-b5120d352b53.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>🦒 Feeling wild with <strong>Tripping Animals</strong><br>• <strong>Tranquilo Y Tropical </strong>Sour with Lulo, Mango &amp; Strawberries (brewed with <strong>J Wakefield</strong>)<br>• <strong>Golden Poison Dart Frog </strong>Sour with Orange, Key Lime, Blood Orange &amp; Vanilla<br>• <strong>Umbra </strong>DDH West Coast IPA with Mosaic, Riwaka &amp; Nectaron (collab with <strong>Ghost Town</strong>)<br>• <strong>To Sudan the Last</strong> Triple IPA with Mosaic, Amarillo, Simcoe &amp; Florida Orange Blossom Honey<br>• <strong>Chromatic Haze </strong>DDH Hazy IPA with Tangier, Kohia Nelson, Southern Cross &amp; Zkittlez Gold terpenes</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/1676fe9c-562d-b7d2-a5c9-1b514f91bbce.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>🍚 NJ’s <strong>Alternate Ending</strong><br>• <strong>Amity Beer </strong>pale lager<br>• <strong>Vaya con Dios </strong>West Coast IPA with Cascade &amp; Citra<br>• <strong>El Guapo </strong>Mexican light lager<br>• <strong>Lunchbox</strong> Hazy IPA with Citra, Mosaic &amp; Nectaron (collab with <strong>Kane Brewing</strong>)<br>• <strong>Small Things in Big Countries </strong>Basmati Rice Lager (collab with <strong>Queue Beer</strong>)</p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/48650345-a71e-e633-0876-745ed9b4cc7d.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>😎 Dessert courtesy of <strong>Xul</strong><br>• <strong>PB&amp;J Mixtape</strong> gluten free sour<br>• <strong>Everybody Loves the Sunshine</strong> Limoncello-inspired gluten free sour<br>• <strong>Betty’s Blueberry Peach Cobbler</strong> gluten free sour</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/8c63bb8d-4cc6-6d5a-f2bd-5e7c5515fa33.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>👓 Always better thanks to <strong>Dancing Gnome</strong><br>• <strong>Pivot</strong> West Coast Pale Ale with Citra, Simcoe &amp; Chinook<br>• <strong>Lustra </strong>Hazy Pale Ale with Citra<br>• <strong>Better One or Two </strong>DIPA<br>• <strong>Neo-Retro </strong>Hazy IPA with Dolcita<br>• <strong>Tesselate</strong> West Coast IPA with Mosaic</p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/9161675d-790d-1bc4-acb2-97bbf30d3af3.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p>🏖️ Straight from VA Beach thanks to <strong>Commonwealth</strong>!<br>• <strong>Everywhen </strong>DIPA with Galaxy<br>• <strong>Razzburi Phantasy</strong> Gose with Plum, Peach, Raspberry, Lemon &amp; Lime Zest</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/1072666c-3e2a-74fb-48a3-b84b0afc58ec.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>💯 </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Rhine